Let spN : Z := fr_sp (lastf G CATCHd).
Hypothesis Hres : ltac2:(zQ "10!mjb@1$0?1f").
Hypothesis HINV0 : ltac2:(zQ "60!kvf!mk3!mka!hnd!lkc!ll3@6$4$3?2E0@1$1@1$2?1f@1$0$5?2R0?3M00").
Hypothesis Hch2 : forall Θ, Θ 0%nat = ev E0 0%nat -> chainT2 stof Θ M00 midP2 1152 G.
