Hypothesis Hspf : fr_sp f = A + 1152.
Hypothesis Hspg : ltac2:(zQ "60!ml3!h4!it4!mlc!mka!mm7@3$1$2@2$5@1$0?1f@1$3@1$4?1f@1$0?1g").
Hypothesis Hra : ltac2:(zQ "70!h4!l6!it4!llb!lq8!tf!is1@3$0$2@2$6@1$1#k0@2$5?2E0Nme@1$3@1$4?1g").
Hypothesis Hsaved : ltac2:(zQ "a0!j7!h4!ls2!ltd!l6!mi6!mr3!mka!tf!na>1k$0>0@2$3^1@1$6@1$7?1f@3$1@1$9@1$4#k0@2$8?2E0@2$2Nmf^2@2$5?1g^2").
Hypothesis Hcnt : ltac2:(zQ "30!mj5!mr3!mka@2$0@1$1@1$2?1fNc").
Hypothesis Hlive : ltac2:(zQ "c0!j7!isf!h4!ls2!mj5!ltd!l6!mi6!mr3!mka!tf!na>1k$0>0@2$1@2$4@1$8@1$9?1f^1@2$5^1N8@3$2@1$b@1$6#k0@2$a?2E0@2$3Nnc^2@2$7?1g^2").
